# Force LF line endings for everything, regardless of platform/autocrlf
# settings. Without this, GitHub's windows-latest runners (which default
# to core.autocrlf=true) convert these LF-committed files to CRLF on
# checkout, and gofmt -l then flags every file as unformatted — that's
# what broke ci.yml's lint (windows-latest) job even though the exact
# same commit passed lint (ubuntu-latest) cleanly.
* text=auto eol=lf
